// Your series budget (S5, decision 014). Every series from this host passes through one of these three
// before it's sent. Grafana Cloud's free tier allows 10,000 active series for all hosts together
// (contracts/metrics.yaml). With no rules, everything is sent.
//
// Rules are Prometheus relabelling (https://grafana.com/docs/alloy/latest/reference/components/prometheus/prometheus.relabel/):
//   rule { source_labels = ["__name__"]  regex = "node_(cpu|memory)_.*"  action = "keep" }
//   rule { regex = "id"  action = "labeldrop" }

declare "host" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Drop non-physical/virtual network interfaces
		rule {
			source_labels = ["device"]
			regex         = "(lo|veth.*|br-.*|docker0)"
			action        = "drop"
		}

		// Keep only root filesystem mounts
		rule {
			source_labels = ["mountpoint"]
			regex         = "/(sys|proc|dev|etc|run).*"
			action        = "drop"
		}

		// Keep essential host node metrics
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "node_(cpu_seconds_total|memory_Mem(Total|Available|Free)_bytes|filesystem_(free|size|avail)_bytes|network_(receive|transmit)_bytes_total|load[15]|disk_(read|write)s_completed_total)"
			action        = "keep"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}

declare "containers" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Drop metrics from unnamed containers (e.g. root cgroups)
		rule {
			source_labels = ["name"]
			regex         = ""
			action        = "drop"
		}

		// Drop high-churn labels that change on every blue-green deploy
		rule {
			regex  = "(id|image|container_label_.*)"
			action = "labeldrop"
		}

		// Keep essential container resource metrics
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "container_(cpu_usage_seconds_total|memory_working_set_bytes|network_(receive|transmit)_bytes_total)"
			action        = "keep"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}

declare "services" {
	argument "forward_to" { }

	prometheus.relabel "rules" {
		forward_to = argument.forward_to.value

		// Keep only lab contracts metrics and Traefik service metrics
		rule {
			source_labels = ["__name__"]
			regex         = "(lab_.*|traefik_service_(requests_total|request_duration_seconds_.*))"
			action        = "keep"
		}
	}

	export "receiver" {
		value = prometheus.relabel.rules.receiver
	}
}
